    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mysterious world where science fiction and fantasy merge</h2></strong><br>In the world of Struggle for, there are humans, elves, dwarves, dinosaurs, dragons, wyverns, and various fantastical elements.<br>Although at first glance the world appears to be a fantasy world, <br>traces of science can be found here and there. And robots made with advanced technology...<br><br>In such a dangerous and mysterious world, we will explore for the sake of survival and human development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/ff8f25a8a39ad642cd908bb060e13123.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy-to-play action RPG</h2></strong><br>There are no difficult controls at all.<br>You can enjoy exhilarating battles with easy and simple controls!<br>Choose the armament and effects suggested by the gadgets to suit the situation, overcome increasingly intense offensives, and bring back more resources!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/2a7a109ecf08f20335232f36cd177411.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So cool! Cute! Attractive characters</h2></strong><br>Dozens of unique enemy characters vary in appearance conditions, such as region, weather, and day-night differences.<br>Gather compatible allies and weaponry, combine them strategically, and strive to gain the upper hand in battles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/7ced88ba83f422e4b0cd4fb827a0ed25.avif?t=1735199654\" width=580 height=156 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can make almost all enemies your allies!</h2></strong><br>Moreover, there are rare allies that are not easily encountered within the game.<br>Your allies can vary based on factors such as location, time of day, and weather.<br>Some of them are rare and hard to find.<br>By gathering and combining allies with various characteristics, you'll be able to experience a diverse range of battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/7e61185ab510d0107d55e53e036fc590.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fulfilling and enjoyable growth system.</h2></strong><br>The characters who become your allies have different personalities and strengths. <br>As you train them, you can also enhance them to your own liking. <br><br>Furthermore, by selecting partners and utilizing methods such as breeding and fusion, you can give birth to offspring inheriting talents, allowing you to raise even stronger individuals.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A village that serve as a base of daily life</h2></strong><br>There are very few places in this world where humans can live in peace.<br>The first village you visited was one of those few places where we could live in peace.<br>In return for being accepted, the girl will accept a job in this village.<br>The residents also help her in many ways.<br>They make weapons and tools, strengthen them, and help with breeding.<br>With the support of the residents, you can explore the area and gather materials and information,<br>and develop your community as you go.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/ecd746604dd8efe14c3ae3fed1da9cc8.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The regions will be revealed one after another.</h2></strong><br>By using the materials obtained in each region to develop weapons, armor, and to train your allies,  your fighting strength improve and<br>you will be able to challenge new regions.<br>Depending on the region, different enemies and materials will appear.<br>The environment is also different in each region, so you will need to be prepared for the weather and temperature, such as protection against cold and heat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/1de304c271dc7ffd4a55d6483e463d4f.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super-powerful bosses! Fierce dungeons!</h2></strong><br>Each region has its own unique dungeons and bosses.<br>Using materials collected in the region to craft weapons and armor by residents of village, <br>and if you have strengthened your equipment and the creatures that have become your allies, you are ready to take on the challenge!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/c6d8231b1b0268a740f7d21a79528f21.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mysterious world where science fiction and fantasy merge</h2></strong><br>In the world of Struggle for, there are humans, elves, dwarves, dinosaurs, dragons, wyverns, and various fantastical elements.<br>Although at first glance the world appears to be a fantasy world, <br>traces of science can be found here and there. And robots made with advanced technology...<br><br>In such a dangerous and mysterious world, we will explore for the sake of survival and human development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/ff8f25a8a39ad642cd908bb060e13123.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy-to-play action RPG</h2></strong><br>There are no difficult controls at all.<br>You can enjoy exhilarating battles with easy and simple controls!<br>Choose the armament and effects suggested by the gadgets to suit the situation, overcome increasingly intense offensives, and bring back more resources!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/2a7a109ecf08f20335232f36cd177411.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So cool! Cute! Attractive characters</h2></strong><br>Dozens of unique enemy characters vary in appearance conditions, such as region, weather, and day-night differences.<br>Gather compatible allies and weaponry, combine them strategically, and strive to gain the upper hand in battles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/7ced88ba83f422e4b0cd4fb827a0ed25.avif?t=1735199654\" width=580 height=156 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can make almost all enemies your allies!</h2></strong><br>Moreover, there are rare allies that are not easily encountered within the game.<br>Your allies can vary based on factors such as location, time of day, and weather.<br>Some of them are rare and hard to find.<br>By gathering and combining allies with various characteristics, you'll be able to experience a diverse range of battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/7e61185ab510d0107d55e53e036fc590.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fulfilling and enjoyable growth system.</h2></strong><br>The characters who become your allies have different personalities and strengths. <br>As you train them, you can also enhance them to your own liking. <br><br>Furthermore, by selecting partners and utilizing methods such as breeding and fusion, you can give birth to offspring inheriting talents, allowing you to raise even stronger individuals.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A village that serve as a base of daily life</h2></strong><br>There are very few places in this world where humans can live in peace.<br>The first village you visited was one of those few places where we could live in peace.<br>In return for being accepted, the girl will accept a job in this village.<br>The residents also help her in many ways.<br>They make weapons and tools, strengthen them, and help with breeding.<br>With the support of the residents, you can explore the area and gather materials and information,<br>and develop your community as you go.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/ecd746604dd8efe14c3ae3fed1da9cc8.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The regions will be revealed one after another.</h2></strong><br>By using the materials obtained in each region to develop weapons, armor, and to train your allies,  your fighting strength improve and<br>you will be able to challenge new regions.<br>Depending on the region, different enemies and materials will appear.<br>The environment is also different in each region, so you will need to be prepared for the weather and temperature, such as protection against cold and heat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/1de304c271dc7ffd4a55d6483e463d4f.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=288 /></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Super-powerful bosses! Fierce dungeons!</h2></strong><br>Each region has its own unique dungeons and bosses.<br>Using materials collected in the region to craft weapons and armor by residents of village, <br>and if you have strengthened your equipment and the creatures that have become your allies, you are ready to take on the challenge!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633080/extras/c6d8231b1b0268a740f7d21a79528f21.avif?t=1735199654\" width=512 height=286 /></span>",
